sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User (tenant A)
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant O as Orders
  participant B as Billing
  participant L as Ledger
  U->>G: 1. request, with user token
  G->>G: 2. validate token: user and tenant proven
  Note over U,G: the caller is known here, and only here
  G->>O: 3. internal call, as the gateway's service identity
  Note over G,O: mTLS: channel proven, caller dropped
  O->>B: 4. charge account, IDs from the request
  Note over O,B: mTLS: channel proven, caller unknown
  B->>L: 5. write entry, tenant_id from the request body
  Note over B,L: mTLS: channel proven, caller unknown
  L->>L: 6. no user check: the call came from inside
  Note over L: whose request is this?<br/>the ledger cannot answer
